          "purpose": "welcome: introduce the brand and its happiness-first spirit",
          "subject": "Welcome to Cake-me 💛",
          "preheader": "Artisanal cheesecakes made to turn everyday moments into little celebrations you can share.",
          "headline": "Hey you, welcome to the Cake-me crew! 🌟",
          "body_blocks": [
            "We're so happy you're here! Cake-me is all about artisanal cheesecakes that turn everyday moments into memorable, shareable celebrations of happiness.",
            "We're not just a dessert shop. We create happiness! Think of us as the friend who always turns up with something delicious to share.",
