            "Cake-me sees itself as a creator of happiness, not just a dessert shop"
          ]
        },
        {
          "day_offset": 3,
          "purpose": "value: help readers explore the real cheesecakes and picture their own moment",
          "subject": "Which moment will you celebrate? 🩷",
          "preheader": "Browse the real cheesecakes on our site and picture the moment each one would make better.",
          "headline": "Find the cheesecake for your moment",
          "body_blocks": [
            "A lazy Sunday. A surprise visit. A \"just because\" kind of day. Any moment can turn into a celebration, and we love that for you!",
            "Hop over to our site and browse the cheesecakes at your own pace. Take a good look at each one and imagine who you'd share it with.",
            "We made them to be shared, so go on and pick your favorite 💛"
          ],
          "cta": {
            "label": "Browse the cheesecakes",
